   "text": "# Tag board \u00b7 2026_demo-fluxbench \u00b7 lanes = journey/*\nDrag a card into another lane (or copy it into several), then run:\n`python3 _system/scripts/canvas_sync.py 2026_demo-fluxbench` to update the tags. Cards outside every lane are left untouched.\nRegenerate the board: `python3 _system/scripts/tag_board.py 2026_demo-fluxbench --canvas --dimension journey`"
